# Trivy ignore list for go-frost.
#
# The gate is a SOURCE filesystem scan (trivy fs) of the shipped Go module plus
# an image scan of the container this repository builds, both failing on
# CRITICAL/HIGH (conventions/devops.md §8). test/ is skipped on the filesystem
# scan: it holds the transport harness and RFC 9591 vectors, none of which ship
# to a consumer of the library.
#
# Add specific advisory IDs below ONLY when a finding is confirmed
# not-applicable or unfixable, with a one-line justification AND the date it
# was accepted. An entry without both is a defect.
#
# Example:
# CVE-XXXX-XXXXX  # 2026-01-01 <reason this advisory does not apply to go-frost>
